      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Li Yitong (Chinese: 李一桐, born 6 September 1990) is a Chinese actress. She made her acting debut in 2016 with a leading role in the web series \"Demon Girl\" by Yu Zheng. In 2017, she played Huang Rong in the television adaptation of Jin Yong's wuxia (武侠) novel \"Legend of the Condor Heroes\" and rose to fame in China.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999969113145,
